UID:curiodyssey-10000709@local-events
DESCRIPTION:@ 			\n			\n							\n		\n			\n\n\n\n\nStep into the baylands a
 nd explore the vibrant marsh ecosystem right outside our doors. Join CuriO
 dyssey educators for a guided hike through Coyote Point’s wetlands\, whe
 re we’ll look for native plants\, local wildlife\, and signs of seasonal
  change.\n\nThis event is free and open to the public. RSVP is required. A
 ll children must be accompanied by their grown-up for the duration of the 
 hike.\n\nWe will gather at CuriOdyssey before heading out to the marsh tog
 ether. Participants of all ages are welcome\, and young explorers should p
 lan to attend with their adult or guardian.More information\, including th
 e exact meeting location and what to bring\, will be shared upon registrat
 ion. \n\nPlease note that parking is managed by San Mateo County Parks\, 
