UID:hiller-10017549@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Scout Day\n\nThe Hiller Aviation Museum provides complimentary
  admission to all BSA Scouts and Girl Scouts in uniform on Scout Days!  V
 isit the Museum’s collection of over 50 historic aircraft\, discover fli
 ght with various interactive exhibits\, and join the fun with hands-on exp
 lorations in the Invention Lab\, Drone Plex\, and Flight Sim Zone (additio
 nal fee applies for flight simulation).  Explore historic airplanes and h
 elicopters and learn more about the special programs offered at the Hiller
  Aviation Museum for BSA Scouts and Girl Scouts throughout the year.\n
 \nNo reservations are necessary\, arrive in uniform for an exciting day of
  aviation discovery.  Adult leaders in uniform or with Scout ID are also 
 admitted at no charge.  Standard admission fees apply for parents and sib
 lings (no charge…\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.hiller.org/even
 t/scout-day/2027-01-17/\nLast synced: 2026-09-03 09:57 PDT
